,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1050","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[53,23,77,83,73,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1050","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[53,23,77,83,73,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[53,23,77,83,73,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16100","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1050","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[53,23,77,83,73,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"16350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[53,23,77,83,73,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"16350","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007902","armor":"WP1017505","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国官臣，顾邵长子，顾雍之孙。自幼受家族严格教育，弱冠之年即与诸葛恪、张休、陈表并列为“太子四友”。顾雍去世后任太常，“二宫之争”中对孙权屡进忠言，努力调和二宫关系，坚持嫡庶有序的原则，拒绝妥协，导致与鲁王党（全琮、步骘等）矛盾激化。后被全琮陷害而遭流放，两年后卒于交趾，享年42岁。","tc":"吳國官臣，顧邵長子，顧雍之孫。自幼受家族嚴格教育，弱冠之年即與諸葛恪、張休、陳表并列為“太子四友”。顧雍去世后任太常，“二宮之爭”中對孫權屢進忠言，努力調和二宮關系，堅持嫡庶有序的原則，拒絕妥協，導致與魯王黨（全琮、步騭等）矛盾激化。后被全琮陷害而遭流放，兩年后卒于交趾，享年42歲。","en":"A Wu official, eldest son of Gu Shao and grandson of Gu Yong. Raised under strict family discipline, he was named one of the ‘Four Friends of the Crown Prince’ alongside Zhuge Ke, Zhang Xiu, and Chen Biao in his twenties. After Gu Yong's death, he served as Undersecretary. During the ‘Two Palaces crisis’ he repeatedly offered loyal counsel to Sun Quan, striving to mediate the factions and insisting on the principle of primogeniture. He refused to compromise, which brought him into bitter conflict with the Lu Prince faction, including Quan Cong and Bu Zhi. He was later framed by Quan Cong and exiled, dying in Jiaozhi two years later at the age of forty-two.","jp":"呉の臣。顧邵の長男で、顧雍の孫。幼少より家族から厳格な教育を受け、弱冠にして諸葛恪、張休、陳表とともに「太子四友」と並び称された。顧雍の死後は太常を務めた。「二宮の変」では孫権に度々忠言を呈し、二宮の関係調停に努めつつも、嫡庶の秩序を守る原則を堅持して妥協を拒んだため、魯王派（全琮、歩騭ら）との対立が激化した。後に全琮に陥れられて追放され、2年後に交趾で没した。享年42。","kr":"오나라의 신하로, 고소의 장남이자 고옹의 손자이다. 어려서부터 가문의 엄격한 교육을 받았으며, 약관의 나이에 제갈각, 장휴, 진표와 함께 나란히 '태자사우(太子四友)'로 꼽혔다. 고옹이 세상을 떠난 후 태상에 올랐으며, '이궁의 변' 당시 손권에게 거듭 충언을 올리고 양측의 관계를 중재하고자 노력했다. 적서의 구분을 지키는 원칙을 고수하며 타협을 거부하여 노왕파(전종, 보즐 등)와의 갈등이 격화되었다. 이후 전종의 모함을 받아 유배되었으며, 2년 뒤 교지에서 세상을 떠났다. 향년 42세였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10218","remark":"","surname":"顾","surnameTc":"顧","surnameEn":"Gu","surnameJp":"顧","surnameKr":"고","surnameOther":"","name":"谭","nameTc":"譚","nameEn":"Tan","nameJp":"譚","nameKr":"담","nameOther":"","word":"子默","wordTc":"子默","wordEn":"Zimo","wordJp":"子黙","wordKr":"자묵","wordOther":"","icon":"顾谭","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0",